lementary school and then me and  donny continued on through high school  together so i think that friendship you  know that the base of that is a lot of  the reasons we've been able to stay  together i love that because there are  so many stories unlike that one where  bands break up and maybe one or two  original members are still a part of  what's going on today so that's really  cool what makes that unique is it  because of  the connection that you had beforehand  or just the chemistry and jill in  general  i think we just know each other a lot  better than maybe other bands would and  we um we compromise you know and in the  end  it's always what we do on stage for the  fans is what's most important so we tend  to always agree on that kind of stuff  and try to strive to make each tour  better than the last one absolutely love  it when did you know that new kids on  the block was  making it that you were no longer just  friends from high school that you were  actually a band that was  taking the world by storm  i think when we released right stuff as  our second single um  and we were going on tour for a second  time um with tiffany  and  we were still opening for her like the  summer before  but after the first show you could kind  of tell  it needed to be kind of reversed and  um you know we everything took off from  there and it's incredible because you  have man maintained a fan base uh all  these many years and the reception is  very warm including the one you have  coming up here at mandalay bay how  invigorating is that and and how good  does it feel that you still have such a  following  well we we now have categories of fans  like you have the og blockheads who are  the original  you know people that have been with us  since the 80s and now you have the  second generation blockheads maybe girls  that  are in their  early twenties that came to our you know  the reunion in 2008 and now you have the  baby blockheads they're like  you know between eight and fourteen  and there's just a lot of them out in  the crowd so we're just lucky to still  be doing this after all these years and  you have some legendary guests uh coming  with you on this tour  yeah we have involved salt and pepper  and rick ashley and  in vogue and song pepper have never  toured together and every night i get to  watch them do what a man  together  is like a highlight of the show  well i know so many people are looking  forward to it danny thanks so much for  joining us today and good luck with all  of the tour  thank you thank you for having me new  kids on the block bringing the mixtape  tour 2022 featuring salt and pepper rick  astley in vogue as legendary special  guest comes to mickelove ultra arena at  mandalay bay this sunday rocky the

